Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:15.63,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's so nice and cool in the shade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.36,0:00:17.86,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.19,0:00:19.31,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.31,0:00:22.36,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,We gotta decide where we're \Ngoin' over summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:24.38,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Right, it's summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:26.71,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Upsy-daisy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:28.73,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:34.43,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:38.61,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Some things never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.61,0:00:41.80,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,At this point, I hardly think anything of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:44.36,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It really is summer...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:49.87,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.46,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,And the sun's particularly bright today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:54.86,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an9\fnArial\fs18\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(527,174)}Zero\NResistance\Nto the Sun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Whoa, cold! Wh-What...?
