Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.69,0:02:38.38,Main - Top,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Did I startle you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:41.09,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:45.69,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Make sure you stay hydrated, Izumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.69,0:02:46.84,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She's dazzling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:48.71,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Like a model in a commercial!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.32,0:02:54.95,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You can get under my parasol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:56.63,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:58.56,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Thanks, Hachimitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:02:59.83,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:01.56,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, it's just Hachimitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.19,0:03:03.98,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll hold it, Hachimitsu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:05.82,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,How thoughtful of you, Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.14,0:03:09.69,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I know! I wanna go to the \Nbeach over summer break!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.69,0:03:10.41,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:12.29,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,The beach?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:15.04,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,She sure is excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:18.04,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I guess Shikimori-san really likes summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:20.05,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(128.333,79.333)}Into Culture
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:22.05,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(540.333,79.333)}Into Athletics
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:22.05,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,The beach is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:24.06,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Nothing says summer like the beach, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:24.05,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(185.273,92.333)}Summer ✕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:24.05,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(186,195.787)}Winter 〇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.06,0:03:25.79,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:25.80,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(522,75.333)}Summer 〇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.20,0:03:25.80,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(522,173.333)}Winter ✕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:29.30,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,The beach, huh? It does sound fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.53,0:03:34.92,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,But I always burn instantly and\N make things harder for everyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.25,0:03:39.03,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,so I just end up sitting \Nin the shade watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.78,0:03:43.89,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Wait, wouldn't the river be better?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.45,0:03:47.54,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi likes cooler places more, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:50.89,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,He's sensitive to the sun, \Nbut we can still swim at the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.89,0:03:53.83,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, man! The river sounds great, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.10,0:03:55.71,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,H-Hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:03:58.33,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,If you want to go to the beach, \Ndon't hold back on my account.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:00.78,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,We're not holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:05.06,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,We're discussing this because we want \Nto go somewhere we can all enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:06.21,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.43,0:04:11.97,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,What's your pick, Izumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.35,0:04:14.18,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I-I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.27,0:04:19.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'd also... like to go to the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.77,0:04:21.86,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,It's settled, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.16,0:04:26.43,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Izumi and the river still sounds like \Na dangerous combination, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:27.24,Main,Inu/Neko/Izumi,0,0,0,,Gulp!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:29.43,Main,Inu/Neko,0,0,0,,G-Good point...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.78,0:04:31.03,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:34.97,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:39.49,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You're so cool, Micchon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:42.99,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Too cool! The coolest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:46.27,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,C-Come on... You're gonna make me mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.27,0:04:48.60,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're embarrassed! How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:49.64,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:51.50,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're all red!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:52.02,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You okay with the river, Hachimitsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:53.06,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,{\an8}I am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:55.99,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I want to lounge around at someone's \Nhouse with the AC blasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.99,0:04:56.76,Main,Inu/Neko,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.05,0:05:01.02,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Spending all summer break \Nlounging around at home is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:04.46,Main,Inu/Neko,0,0,0,,That's a good idea, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.46,0:05:05.68,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Let's do it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:07.20,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I think anything would be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:09.63,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, I wanna go to a festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:12.29,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,This summer...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.65,0:05:15.28,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,might just be...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:17.79,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,the best I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:21.80,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFDFCFE&\blur4\3c&H404142&\pos(319.666,275.333)}A Few Days Later
