Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:26.80,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,1)\pos(415,286)\fnComic Sans MS\fs20\shad0\3c&HFAFBF9&\c&H7267B7&}Final Exam Week
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:29.50,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Finals week kicks off today!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:32.16,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,That means all clubs are on break!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:33.91,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Y-You sound happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:35.02,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.02,0:05:38.73,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Because the best way to spend\Nthe first day of summer is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:42.21,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Going shopping for our river trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.21,0:05:45.32,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,What gives? We came 'cause \Nyou said we were gonna study!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:48.32,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,What do you even want to buy? \NLet's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:51.38,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, we already have all the \Nstuff we need for a barbecue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:57.71,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You don't get it at all. \NYou are {\i1}so{\i0} clueless...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.97,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You're totally thinking up \Nsomething now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:03.25,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,If we're going to the river, \Nwe need swimsuits!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:05.78,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:09.01,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(196.333,59.333)}Totally On Board
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:09.01,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Uh, only little kids wear \Nswimsuits at the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:11.02,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You're no help at all today!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:13.13,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Well, we're all in trouble if we don't study!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.13,0:06:15.20,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're more serious than \Nyour face suggests.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:16.61,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}My face is serious, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:17.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Will you be swimming, Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:21.02,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, me? Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:25.28,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,1)\fnArial\fs18\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(473,87)}Zero Resistance to the Sun
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:25.28,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,1)\fnArial\fs18\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(449.182,157.182)}Sunburned All Over
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:24.76,Flashback_Italics,Motoko,0,0,0,,You poor, poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:28.13,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Nah, I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:31.06,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,So you won't be wearing a swimsuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:33.41,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:34.66,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,No reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:38.51,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I was just thinking that's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.52,0:06:40.26,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.06,0:06:43.29,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wait, wh-what does that mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:49.19,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,It feels like Izumi's always right \Nin the palm of Micchon's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.19,0:06:51.56,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Sometimes her "Teasermori" side comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.31,0:06:54.45,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Come shop swimsuits with us, Micchon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:57.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,If Izumi-san won't be swimming, \NI don't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:58.56,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.94,0:07:00.58,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Well, we're gonna go look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:01.82,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Whoo-hoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:05.52,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Those two really just do their own thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:09.52,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What should the three of us do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:21.42,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Those abs sure are something...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:22.59,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,That's so cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.80,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:27.31,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.31,0:07:28.94,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm going to the restroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:29.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:33.30,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The restrooms are the other \Nway, Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.33,0:07:38.04,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You and I might as well go\N to the food court and study.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:47.14,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Th-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.79,0:07:50.51,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's the one from that ad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.51,0:07:52.87,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hey, Micchon! You're here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:53.90,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:08:01.44,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Isn't this swimsuit wild?! \NWhat's with the frills?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.44,0:08:02.59,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Don't hold it up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:10.39,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Y-You can't go with that one, Micchon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:11.26,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,W-Wait, this isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:12.96,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's not what it looks like, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.96,0:08:17.05,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I-Izumi-san was looking at an ad \Nwith this swimsuit in it earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.05,0:08:19.34,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I figured he must like this kind of thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.34,0:08:22.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,So I was just looking!\N That's all! I wouldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.50,0:08:24.47,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ah! So that ticked you off, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.69,0:08:28.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:29.80,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I hear ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:31.24,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Must be rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.62,0:08:34.13,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You do hate losing, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.13,0:08:35.02,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.02,0:08:36.36,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You didn't realize?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:38.21,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I guess you wouldn't, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.21,0:08:39.58,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.58,0:08:41.18,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,It doesn't usually show,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.18,0:08:43.62,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,but it creeps up every now and then.\NLike right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.53,0:09:09.31,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hey, Hachimitsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.31,0:09:10.16,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:13.90,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Isn't Shikimori, like... super cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.47,0:09:16.39,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Who's Shikimori again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.39,0:09:19.41,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,She's in our class! \NRemember your own classmates!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.41,0:09:22.58,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,That small face, that silky hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:25.17,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,She's slender, she's smart,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:27.68,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,she has big eyes and long eyelashes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:31.36,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,And on top of all that, she's super nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.58,0:09:34.29,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,She tops the list of girls \Nyou'd want to marry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:38.64,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,She's a classic Japanese beauty! \NShe's way too freakin' graceful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:40.31,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I wanna be her friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.97,0:09:48.28,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Chill out. You're being creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:53.19,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Everyone gets creepy when there's \Na cute girl in front of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:57.20,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I just wanna be friends with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:59.20,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I mean, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:02.11,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,When you're dealing with \Nsomeone that perfect,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.11,0:10:04.49,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,it's hard to know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:06.71,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Exactly! And on top of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:10.50,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I heard she and that Izumi guy\Njust started dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:15.06,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,When they're together, the air around \Nthem is just so pure! It's freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:16.45,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:20.75,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Still, you really adore girls like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:22.55,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,1)\fnArial\fs14\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(452,48)}"Girls Like That" \N{\fs16}Simple and Clean Maidens
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:22.55,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I mean, I'd love to be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:27.01,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I'm too tall, and I'm pretty tactless, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.01,0:10:29.31,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Not like that bothers me or anything, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:33.94,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Girls who are soft and airy and smell nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:37.34,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Ones who make you want to protect them \Njust catch my eye so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.34,0:10:39.44,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,They're my polar opposite!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.67,0:10:41.46,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,What I'm saying is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:44.21,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Shikimori is my ideal woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.61,0:10:45.95,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:47.25,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Yes, she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:52.07,Flashback,Teacher,0,0,0,,Gather 'round, girls! \NWe're starting your basketball game!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.57,0:10:53.51,Flashback,Students,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.05,0:10:56.02,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,All right, game time! I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:54.65,Flashback,Students,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:59.10,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,It's just part of class. \NDon't take it seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:01.04,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:04.21,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I can tell the difference between\Nplaying for real and for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.21,0:11:05.62,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.03,0:11:14.27,Flashback_Italics,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll pass it around as needed \Nand just focus on shooting...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.94,0:11:21.74,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:23.09,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.09,0:11:24.56,Flashback,Girl1,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:25.03,Flashback,Girl2,0,0,0,,That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:26.72,Flashback,Students,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:28.18,Flashback,Students,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.30,0:11:31.81,Flashback,Students,0,0,0,,That was so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:39.03,Flashback,Girl1,0,0,0,,One more goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:40.03,Flashback,Students,0,0,0,,Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:40.98,Flashback,Students,0,0,0,,You've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.98,0:11:41.93,Flashback_Italics,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,That little...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:55.66,Flashback,Girl1,0,0,0,,A three-pointer?! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.66,0:11:56.73,Flashback,Girl2,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.73,0:11:58.95,Flashback,Girl3,0,0,0,,Nice one, Nekozaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:13.92,Flashback,Boy1,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.92,0:12:16.12,Flashback,Boy2,0,0,0,,It doesn't even seem like a girls' game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.28,0:12:20.89,Flashback,Girl3,0,0,0,,H-How did this even happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:24.31,Flashback,Girl3,0,0,0,,They're taking this too seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:24.89,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs48\move(39,-94,39,94)\shad0\bord1\3c&H58689B&\c&H161F2C&}R
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:24.89,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs44\shad0\bord1\3c&H58689B&\c&H161F2C&\move(147,-80,147,80)}U
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:24.89,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs42\shad0\bord1\3c&H58689B&\c&H161F2C&\move(269,-83,269,83)}M
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:24.89,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs42\shad0\bord1\3c&H58689B&\c&H161F2C&\move(366,-103,366,103)}B
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:24.89,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs48\shad0\bord1\3c&H58689B&\c&H161F2C&\move(492,-83,492,83)}L
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:24.89,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs40\shad0\bord1\3c&H58689B&\c&H161F2C&\move(579,-71,579,71)}E
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.13,0:12:27.63,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,She doesn't know the difference at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:30.59,Flashback_Italics,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,What's her deal? This is a first...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.59,0:12:32.50,Flashback_Italics,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I've never met a girl like her before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:36.08,Flashback_Italics,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,She's usually so cute, but right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:39.64,Flashback_Italics,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,She's unbelievably cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.62,0:12:48.96,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Good game. That was fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:51.48,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, Nekozaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.87,0:12:53.41,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hey, Shikimori...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.81,0:12:56.42,Flashback,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Let's have lunch together today!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.31,0:13:01.08,Flashback,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:03.93,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,That's really what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.93,0:13:05.57,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You forgot about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:08.67,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon has always hated \Nlosing with a passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:12.05,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, come on... \NIt's not that I hate losing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.05,0:13:13.21,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.21,0:13:15.85,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Okay, let's find a swimsuit \Nthat looks good on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:17.08,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:24.62,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hmm... Are we supposed to \Nwrite all of this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.62,0:13:25.44,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:30.95,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\c&H35393B&\3c&HF9FDFA&\4c&HF9FDFA&\bord4\blur4}\h\h\h\h\h\h(1) When the sum equals 9  (2) When the product equals 8\N\h\h\h\h\h\h(3) The outcome of each roll is greater than the previous \N\N{\b1\c&HE6BC7F&}26.{\b0\c&H35393B&} Two dice are rolled three times. Write the number of outcomes\N\h\h\h\h\h\h that produce the following results.\N\h\h\h\h\h\h(1) 4 or 6  (2) A multiple of 4  (3) Less than 15\N\N{\b1\c&HE6BC7F&}27.{\b0\c&H35393B&} Write how many resulting terms are possible when each\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\hof the following expressions is expanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:29.62,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, you can just write the \Ntree diagram that fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:30.94,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:34.40,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,That's it. I knew you'd get it, Inuzuka-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:36.95,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,That's not too encouraging \Ncoming from you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.95,0:13:40.46,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Oh, finally, there they are. \NTook you long enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.11,0:13:43.23,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll go get another chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.51,0:13:47.48,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're actually studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:49.59,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yeah, because it's finals week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:51.36,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Such a serious student.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.36,0:13:53.38,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm not gonna share my notes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:54.73,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Boo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:54.73,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Here, Hachimitsu-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:55.86,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.02,0:14:00.59,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Say, Shikimori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.95,0:14:04.56,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You look kinda happy. What'd you buy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.10,0:14:07.02,Italics,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Dang, he's sharp!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:09.61,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Dude, she obviously bought a swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:11.62,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:16.35,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I didn't buy anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:18.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:21.41,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Whenever you lie, \Nit's written all over your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.41,0:14:23.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What is it? I'm curious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.49,0:14:25.75,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I'm telling you, I didn't buy anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.75,0:14:31.77,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,{\an8}I mean it! I just did a little browsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:32.54,Italics,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon laughing and then getting \Nmad is so fun to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:34.02,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,{\an8}So no, I didn't buy anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.75,0:14:39.00,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Is it possible... that Micchon is \Nthe one in the palm of {\i1}his{\i0} hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:40.32,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:43.33,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I guess there's no winning against \Nyour own inner nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:51.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That sounds like another \Ndisastrous experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:53.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I haven't been through one \Nthat bad in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:55.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'd believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:15:01.41,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I can't believe all of my writing \Nutensils broke on the same day!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.27,0:15:06.58,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But at least the teacher saw you needed \Nhelp before the exam ended, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:10.56,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Though it took fifteen minutes to \Nfind another pen you could use...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.57,0:15:19.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.83,0:15:21.89,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.77,0:15:25.56,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,L-Let's do our best tomorrow, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.57,0:15:32.07,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\frz27\fnTimes New Roman\fay.03\bord1\pos(309,147)\shad0\b1\c&H05486E&\3c&HB4D1E6&\4c&H5B53A5&}Dictionary of Archaic Japanese \N{\b0\fs16\3c&H8AE0DB&}5th Edition: Revised and Expanded
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.48,0:15:36.32,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I need to get ready for the next round \Nof exams tomorrow, but I just can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.66,0:15:41.08,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,That scared me. The volume's up to max...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:42.83,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fnArial\fs14\an8\pos(323,156)\c&HECEDE1&}Shikimori-san
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:42.83,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.29,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hello, Ijumi here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:46.92,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.92,0:15:49.59,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What has you calling so late at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.84,0:15:49.59,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs18\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(468.333,281.333)}They're Both Very Healthy Kids
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.07,0:15:54.46,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well... I thought you might be \Nburied in your blankets about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.47,0:15:56.97,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnComic Sans MS\fs48\c&HF3FDFF&\3c&H2F2F39&\shad0\bord3}She\Nknows
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.63,0:15:56.97,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I-I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.38,0:15:59.92,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You're not still feeling down, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:02.32,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I-I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.19,0:16:04.69,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.45,0:16:08.76,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Although, I actually called\N for a different reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.48,0:16:12.73,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I just wanted to hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:17.06,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I wish I could've seen her face just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.90,0:16:20.43,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, then shall we talk about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:21.00,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.47,0:16:23.07,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Uh, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:24.25,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.89,0:16:30.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san, can you see \Nthe sky from your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.27,0:16:32.76,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,The sky? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:36.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Can you see the North Star \Nin the northern sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:40.02,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,The northern sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.62,0:16:43.01,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:44.87,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Isn't it pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.83,0:16:46.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:49.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The North Star is part of the \Nconstellation Ursa Minor,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:52.03,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,and it's visible in the \Nnorthern sky year-round.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:57.77,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, and the constellation shaped \Nlike a W below that is Cassiopeia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.77,0:17:00.05,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's visible year-round, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.53,0:17:03.55,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Do you like stars, Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:08.29,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah. I loved our class on constellations \Nin elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:13.59,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But every time my dad \Ntook me out stargazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:14.80,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\fnArial\fs16\b1\frz27\pos(259,83)\shad0\c&HBEB1A3&\3c&H693914&}Star Chart
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:14.81,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,it always rained...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:20.08,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,So I never got to see any \Nreal constellations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.19,0:17:22.81,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,My luck is the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.11,0:17:23.81,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.81,0:17:24.64,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.06,0:17:29.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll take you somewhere you \Ncan see a sky full of stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.35,0:17:30.79,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.84,0:17:36.06,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,In that case, I want to take you \Nsomeplace you want to go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.06,0:17:37.99,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:41.30,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Why? Well, obviously...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.70,0:17:44.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Because I want to see you with \Na happy look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:51.36,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You made sure we're going to the river\Ninstead of the beach this summer for my sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.36,0:17:54.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,So instead of somewhere I want to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:57.68,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I want to take you where {\i1}you{\i0} want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.39,0:17:59.70,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:03.80,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I can't think of anything at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.95,0:18:08.15,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Does that mean there's nowhere\Nshe wants to go with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:13.39,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I think it's just because I want \Nto go wherever you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.05,0:18:17.65,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Whether it's the movies, \Nan amusement park, or the local park...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.65,0:18:19.91,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you, anywhere is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:24.65,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,When I see you having fun, \Nit's fun for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.26,0:18:29.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,So keep going wherever \Nyou want to go, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:33.35,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,And take me along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:36.67,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I love her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.41,0:18:40.94,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, shall we go to sleep now? \NIt's getting late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.94,0:18:41.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:43.62,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.61,0:18:46.60,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:49.95,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,No, I should thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.95,0:18:51.87,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're amazing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:52.61,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:55.18,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,For some reason, I feel a lot better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.73,0:18:59.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I wish I could see you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:03.15,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.15,0:19:06.20,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I'm very tired, \Nso I'm going to sleep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:07.27,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Goodnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:08.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.50,0:19:10.50,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(640,1)\shad0\bord0\fnArial\fs14\an8\c&HECEDE1&\pos(324,179)}Shikimori-san\N{\fs12}Call Ended 1:02.05
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:10.50,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, she hung up...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:14.72,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I-I didn't know she was so tired.\N That was rude of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.49,0:19:18.77,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay! I'm gonna do my best \Non tomorrow's exams, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.10,0:19:20.51,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:25.22,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Yuu, don't yell in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:27.52,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\frz-12\fnArial\fs14\an8\c&HECEDE1&\pos(327,168)}Izumi-san \N{\fs12}Call Ended 1:02.05
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.47,0:19:32.39,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I wish I could've seen \Nhis face when he said that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.25,0:19:37.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:42.84,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I mean, obviously I want \Nto see him, too! Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:43.97,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's the middle of the night. \NKeep it down, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.26,0:19:49.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.98,0:19:48.07,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,Are you listening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:49.89,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(560,440)\fnArial\b1\fs30\frz7\shad0\3c&HDBE6E5&\c&H5126E8&\pos(498,297.999)}S{\fs28\c&H3DCEFE&}E{\fs26\c&H5126E8&}E {\fs26\c&H3DCEFE&}Y{\fs24\c&H5126E8&}O{\fs22\c&H3DCEFE&}U{\c&H5126E8&}~
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:20.96,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs20\b1\fnArial\frz4.5\pos(456,99)\c&HEA711C&\3c&H40E4FF&\shad0}C\NO\NO\NK\NI\NN\NG\N\NC\NL\NA\NS\NS {blue}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:20.96,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\frz5\3c&HA9FFFA&\4c&HA9FFFA&\c&H3830EB&\b1\pos(322,138)}Beginners welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:20.96,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\an1\fs12\shad0\frz5\bord0\pos(338,334)\c&H0B155C&}Classroom
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:27.85,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnArial\fs14\an7\pos(174,55)\c&H666A6B&\3c&HF0F3F1&\b1}Easy Meat and Potato Stew \NIngredients (serves 2) \N{\fs12}Potatoes \NOnions \NShirataki noodles \NCarrots \NBeef
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.97,0:21:22.54,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:24.09,Main,Class,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.74,0:21:27.84,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,We're going to try making a meat dish today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:33.14,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Let's start by preparing the vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:38.07,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,You don't need to be so nervous, Mii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.64,0:21:40.11,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,R-R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.11,0:21:42.72,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone, please begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.72,0:21:43.62,Main,Class,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:48.82,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Let's make something tasty \Nand surprise Yuu, Mii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.82,0:21:49.75,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.75,0:21:51.74,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Let's see. These are...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.65,0:21:54.36,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.36,0:21:55.75,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Motoko-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.75,0:21:57.05,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Dear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.05,0:21:59.24,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Why would you pick it up that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.72,0:22:07.22,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Oh, that won't do, Mii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:09.68,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,When you pull the knife toward you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.72,0:22:14.20,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Like this. Apply more strength on the pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.20,0:22:15.47,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.54,0:22:19.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I-I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.35,0:22:26.23,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.23,0:22:28.61,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,I was trying to get you to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.57,0:22:32.88,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,You're all red. How adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.06,0:22:36.55,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,A-Anyone would turn red after you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.55,0:22:39.20,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,It seems like you have a hard \Ntime cutting with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.20,0:22:40.32,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,She moves at her own pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.32,0:22:44.06,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Oh! Maybe it's a right-handed knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.06,0:22:46.89,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,I'll ask if they have any left-handed ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.52,0:22:51.81,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I still get so nervous \Nwhen I'm alone with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.51,0:22:56.87,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But she invited me along, \Nso I'll do my best to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.87,0:22:58.81,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Mii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.81,0:23:00.57,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,They had one!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.57,0:23:02.31,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.55,0:23:04.88,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.25,0:23:12.84,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.07,0:23:18.82,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,What about you? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.82,0:23:20.15,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Fair question...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:23.18,Main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Please be more careful when handling knives!
